            "review_text": "Rum\nHo Chi Minh City, Vietnam1 contribution\n0\nLovely music and drinks\nJan 2020\nAfter our dining, we came up here to enjoy our drinks. The bar was quite at the time we came up as it is still early and yet not the opening time for this bar (only 1930 HRS), but the staff still open the door to let us in as I insist to have a private time with my wife and so there was no one but us alone. They even sent one of the bartender on 2nd floor up here just to serve us! Thank you for making our night lit up!\nRead more\nWritten January 16, 2020",
